# A field step after an index step resolves in the element the index selects (one path algorithm, U4): an int element has no fields -- the path's own words, said at the field.
fn: work () int
    []: []: int a 2
    int: v a[0]\f
    return: v
end: work
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: work(); stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
